1
00:00:00,965 --> 00:00:05,055
Contracts are long, dense, and easy to sign without reading.

2
00:00:05,105 --> 00:00:08,645
Contract Risk Analyzer reads the fine print for you.

3
00:00:09,652 --> 00:00:14,432
Start by uploading a PDF or Word file, or simply paste the text.

4
00:00:14,482 --> 00:00:17,302
Let's try a one-sided vendor contract.

5
00:00:18,698 --> 00:00:21,848
With one click, the contract is split into clauses,

6
00:00:21,898 --> 00:00:26,738
and a fine-tuned RoBERTa model classifies every clause into one of one hundred

7
00:00:26,788 --> 00:00:27,868
LEDGAR categories.

8
00:00:28,886 --> 00:00:33,306
The verdict comes first: a single risk score from zero to one hundred,

9
00:00:33,356 --> 00:00:36,056
a risk level, and a clear course of action.

10
00:00:36,106 --> 00:00:40,396
Each type of risk counts once, so a long contract is never penalised

11
00:00:40,446 --> 00:00:41,676
just for being long.

12
00:00:42,687 --> 00:00:47,367
Below it, the principal risks are grouped by type and ordered by severity.

13
00:00:50,144 --> 00:00:51,974
Every finding is explainable.

14
00:00:52,024 --> 00:00:56,564
You see the exact clause, the risky phrase highlighted, why it matters,

15
00:00:56,614 --> 00:00:59,214
and a practical recommendation to fix it.

16
00:01:04,050 --> 00:01:09,830
The complete analysis can be downloaded as a print-ready PDF, a Word document,

17
00:01:09,880 --> 00:01:11,630
a web page, or raw JSON.

18
00:01:12,632 --> 00:01:14,762
You can also test a single clause.

19
00:01:14,812 --> 00:01:18,292
The model shows its predicted category, its confidence,

20
00:01:18,342 --> 00:01:20,792
and the other categories it considered.

21
00:01:24,906 --> 00:01:27,166
And the model tab reports live usage,

22
00:01:27,216 --> 00:01:30,976
with honest benchmark results on the LexGLUE LEDGAR test set.

23
00:01:31,981 --> 00:01:33,591
Contract Risk Analyzer.

24
00:01:33,641 --> 00:01:36,261
Read the fine print, before you sign.

25
00:01:36,311 --> 00:01:40,951
Try it free at legal contract risk analyzer dot onrender dot com.
